  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.270" end="00:01.770" ttm:agent="v1">I know it's hard, but</p>
      <p begin="00:01.560" end="00:03.220" ttm:agent="v1">This-this time I can't lose-lose</p>
      <p begin="00:03.220" end="00:04.900" ttm:agent="v1">You-you done changed up</p>
      <p begin="00:04.900" end="00:06.650" ttm:agent="v1">My bank done changed too-too</p>
      <p begin="00:06.650" end="00:08.310" ttm:agent="v1">I'm smoking stardust</p>
      <p begin="00:08.310" end="00:09.980" ttm:agent="v1">I-I can see you straight through</p>
      <p begin="00:09.980" end="00:11.720" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I keep that K, stupid</p>
      <p begin="00:11.720" end="00:15.560" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm in that range movin'</p>
      <p begin="00:15.560" end="00:18.790" ttm:agent="v1">This time I can't lose</p>
      <p begin="00:18.790" end="00:21.900" ttm:agent="v1">My bank done changed too</p>
      <p begin="00:21.900" end="00:25.480" ttm:agent="v1">I-I can see you straight through</p>
      <p begin="00:25.480" end="00:26.980" ttm:agent="v1">I-I can see you straight through</p>
      <p begin="00:25.910" end="00:27.410" ttm:agent="v1">Yuh, I said like—</p>
      <p begin="00:27.330" end="00:28.830" ttm:agent="v1">We moved too fast</p>
      <p begin="00:28.310" end="00:30.010" ttm:agent="v1">Live too much, had to push shit back</p>
      <p begin="00:30.010" end="00:31.680" ttm:agent="v1">Never had trust in the truth you said</p>
      <p begin="00:31.680" end="00:33.400" ttm:agent="v1">Ran it up once and the whole gang set</p>
      <p begin="00:33.400" end="00:35.650" ttm:agent="v1">And I know that, and I know I lost it</p>
      <p begin="00:35.650" end="00:37.150" ttm:agent="v1">Too much in the pants that I walk in</p>
      <p begin="00:37.060" end="00:38.860" ttm:agent="v1">Too stuck in the past, two blunts in the wrap</p>
      <p begin="00:38.860" end="00:40.950" ttm:agent="v1">Two months that had passed when we called it, but like</p>
      <p begin="00:40.950" end="00:42.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I know it's hard, but (I know it's hard, but)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.680" end="00:44.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This time I can't lose (This time I can't lose)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.430" end="00:46.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And you done changed up (You done changed up)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.220" end="00:47.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">My bank done changed too (My bank done changеd too)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.940" end="00:49.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm smoking stardust (I'm smoking stardust)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.790" end="00:51.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I can see you straight through (I can see you straight through)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.040" end="00:52.800" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I keep that K, stupid</p>
      <p begin="00:52.800" end="00:54.330" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm in that range movin'</p>
      <p begin="00:54.330" end="00:55.940" ttm:agent="v1">Haven't been sad in a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:55.940" end="00:57.440" ttm:agent="v1">2 o'clock and thе bag full a Guinness</p>
      <p begin="00:57.380" end="00:58.970" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck around get blasted, finished</p>
      <p begin="00:58.970" end="01:00.550" ttm:agent="v1">Half pound gone but the bank got lifted</p>
      <p begin="01:00.550" end="01:02.100" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, fuck around let's get it</p>
      <p begin="01:02.100" end="01:03.730" ttm:agent="v1">All black walls in the room I sit in</p>
      <p begin="01:03.730" end="01:05.370" ttm:agent="v1">Smoke too much of the dope, I'm trippin'</p>
      <p begin="01:05.370" end="01:06.870" ttm:agent="v1">Money stack tall but the weight on my back</p>
      <p begin="01:06.670" end="01:08.960" ttm:agent="v1">Got the whole world lookin' at me like I'm gifted</p>
      <p begin="01:08.960" end="01:11.430" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, sip it, what you need? I send shipments</p>
      <p begin="01:11.430" end="01:14.650" ttm:agent="v1">I got love in this cup, cocaine and X, sniff it</p>
      <p begin="01:14.650" end="01:16.450" ttm:agent="v1">Pay that off don't need no loan</p>
      <p begin="01:16.450" end="01:18.210" ttm:agent="v1">Thank-thank my angels on my shoulders</p>
      <p begin="01:18.210" end="01:19.870" ttm:agent="v1">Bullets packed inside this chrome</p>
      <p begin="01:19.870" end="01:24.280" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm trippin' one more hit and, bitch, I'm gone</p>
      <p begin="01:24.280" end="01:26.320" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, like where the fuck we goin'?</p>
      <p begin="01:26.320" end="01:27.820" ttm:agent="v1">G-gone-gone</p>
      <p begin="01:27.780" end="01:31.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One-one more hit and, bitch, I'm gone (And bitch I'm gone)</p>
      <p begin="01:31.750" end="01:33.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said, girl, I'm done (Said, girl, I'm done)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.210" end="01:35.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Girl-girl, I'm done (Girl, I'm done)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.240" end="01:36.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said, girl, I'm done (Said, girl, I'm done)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.810" end="01:39.370" ttm:agent="v1">Yu-yuh, tryin' hard to let it go</p>
      <p begin="01:39.370" end="01:43.090" ttm:agent="v1">Too much in my head, smoked the zip, that's my medical</p>
      <p begin="01:43.090" end="01:45.990" ttm:agent="v1">Yuh, uh, fillin' up my chest wit dope</p>
      <p begin="01:45.990" end="01:49.500" ttm:agent="v1">If you got some problems go n' solve 'em, I don't need to know</p>
      <p begin="01:49.500" end="01:51.220" ttm:agent="v1">I know it's hard, but</p>
      <p begin="01:51.220" end="01:52.930" ttm:agent="v1">This-this time I can't lose-lose</p>
      <p begin="01:52.930" end="01:54.680" ttm:agent="v1">You-you-you done changed up</p>
      <p begin="01:54.680" end="01:56.560" ttm:agent="v1">My bank done changed too-too</p>
      <p begin="01:56.560" end="01:58.140" ttm:agent="v1">I'm smoking stardust</p>
      <p begin="01:58.140" end="01:59.710" ttm:agent="v1">I-I can see you straight through</p>
      <p begin="01:59.710" end="02:01.600" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I keep that K, stupid</p>
      <p begin="02:01.600" end="02:03.100" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I'm in that range movin'</p>
      <p begin="02:02.030" end="02:03.580" ttm:agent="v1">Yuh, I said like—</p>
      <p begin="02:03.580" end="02:05.080" ttm:agent="v1">We moved too fast</p>
      <p begin="02:04.560" end="02:06.060" ttm:agent="v1">Live too much, had to push shit back</p>
      <p begin="02:06.020" end="02:07.820" ttm:agent="v1">Never had trust in the truth you said</p>
      <p begin="02:07.820" end="02:09.320" ttm:agent="v1">Ran it up once and the whole gang set</p>
      <p begin="02:09.230" end="02:11.400" ttm:agent="v1">And I know that, and I know I lost it</p>
      <p begin="02:11.400" end="02:12.970" ttm:agent="v1">Too much in the pants I walk in</p>
      <p begin="02:12.970" end="02:14.860" ttm:agent="v1">Too stuck in the past, two blunts in the wrap</p>
      <p begin="02:14.860" end="02:16.840" ttm:agent="v1">Two months that had passed when we called it, but like</p>
      <p begin="02:16.840" end="02:20.840" ttm:agent="v1"/>
